Z||000000||Wannabe||07-26-2001||02:29 PM||||After almost two years of messing around after dumping my Eagle Talon, I finally made it back to the track!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Formula_on_track.jpg"> <P>The Formula is proving to be a pleasure to drive on the track and I just scored a set of brand new R compound (C$50 each!) tires to run on so I may even be competitve now.||||reg||1
